 "description": "<p>The Governance Committee ensures that the governance structures and processes for the Consortium (including the Board) are appropriate and documented. It oversees the governance of the W3C as a global collaboration between Members, Partners, and other contributors.</p>\r\n<p>Learn more in the <a href=\"https://www.w3.org/2022/10/bod-governance.html\">Governance Committee charter</a>.</p>",
